                                                "sense_id": "872321ae-6844-3ce7-b332-5ecd7720cc1a",
                                                "text": "Homemade samosas are a world away from those dry cardboard triangles sold under the name in supermarkets. Instead, they have delicately flaky and deliciously rich pastry and a generous stuffing that’s easily tweaked to suit all tastes. […] Repeat with the remaining dough balls and filling, making sure each samosa is well sealed."
